## Story Description
Extend the TypeScript type system with a flexible Category tree interface (not hardcoded to L1/L2/L3), expand FilterState with analytics-critical dimensions (legal entity, currency, country, categorisation status, ABC segment, confidence threshold), and add interfaces for all new response types from the US-002 endpoints. All existing interfaces are preserved.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: frontend/src/types/index.ts — add new interfaces WITHOUT removing any existing ones
- Add interface Category: { id?: string; category_id: string; parent_category_id?: string | null; category_level: number; category_name: string; taxonomy_version?: string; is_active?: boolean; mapping_confidence?: number; mapping_source?: string; children?: Category[] }
- Add interface LegalEntity: { id?: string; legal_entity_code: string; legal_entity_name: string; country?: string; currency?: string }
- Add interface PaymentTermMapping: { id?: string; raw_payment_term: string; harmonised_payment_term?: string; payment_term_days?: number; discount_percent?: number; discount_days?: number; has_early_payment_discount?: boolean; confidence_score?: number }
