## Story Description
Extend the existing FilterBar component to support the new filter dimensions added in US-003 (legal entity, currency, country, categorisation status, ABC segment, confidence threshold). Add the DrilldownBreadcrumb to CategoryPage and SupplierPage. The FilterBar changes are backwards-compatible — new filter fields only render if the corresponding options array is non-empty, so existing pages that don't supply legal_entity options see no visual change.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: frontend/src/components/dashboard/FilterBar.tsx — add new filter sections below the existing supplier search. All new sections only render if the corresponding options array in FilterOptions has length > 0 (so existing pages are unaffected if they don't pass the new options).
- Add legal entity filter: multi-select using shadcn Select or a custom multi-select pattern, bound to filters.legal_entities. Only renders if options.legal_entities.length > 0.
- Add currency filter: multi-select bound to filters.currencies. Only renders if options.currencies.length > 0.
- Add country filter: multi-select bound to filters.countries. Only renders if options.countries.length > 0.
- Add ABC segment filter: checkbox group (A / B / C) bound to filters.abc_segments. Only renders if options includes abc support (add abc_segments?: ABCSegment[] to FilterOptions).
- Add categorisation status filter: radio group (All / Categorised / Uncategorised) bound to filters.categorisation_statuses[0]. Only renders if options includes categorisation_statuses?: string[].
